### Ekstensi VS Code: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client). Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request.
### Urutan: jalankan dulu request LOGIN di bagian 2 -> token otomatis dipakai request lain.
### Password semua akun seed: rahasia123 (jalankan database/04-seed-password-hashes.sql lebih dulu).

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

############################################################ 0. HEALTH
GET http://localhost:3000/health

############################################################ 1. REGISTER (publik) -> role otomatis customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budi Santoso", "email": "budi@student.test", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Register GAGAL validasi -> 400, format error { status: fail, message, errors[] }
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ab", "email": "bukan-email", "password": "pendek" }

### Register menyelundupkan role -> 400 (body strict)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hacker", "email": "hacker@student.test", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "admin" }

############################################################ 2. LOGIN (publik) -> simpan token per role
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@kantin.test", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
# @name loginOwner
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tini@kantin.test", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bagas@student.test", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Login salah -> 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@kantin.test", "password": "salahsalah" }

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
@ownerToken = {{loginOwner.response.body.data.token}}
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.data.token}}

############################################################ 3. /auth/me (login, semua role)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{base}}/auth/me

############################################################ 4. STALLS
### Publik: daftar (search, category, page, limit) & detail
GET {{base}}/stalls?search=warung&category=Kwetiau&page=1&limit=5
###
GET {{base}}/stalls/1

### Validasi query gagal -> 400
GET {{base}}/stalls?page=0&limit=500

### Validasi params gagal -> 400
GET {{base}}/stalls/abc

### POST /stalls (owner/admin). owner_id = user dari token
POST {{base}}/stalls
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kantin Baru Bu Tini", "category": "Minuman", "location": "Kantin FKIP", "description": "Es teh dan kopi" }

### Tanpa token -> 401
POST {{base}}/stalls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kantin Tanpa Token" }

### Role customer -> 403
POST {{base}}/stalls
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kantin Customer" }

### PUT stall MILIK SENDIRI (Bu Tini = owner stall 1) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/stalls/1
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Kedai kwetiau goreng & kuah (update)" }

### PUT stall MILIK ORANG LAIN (stall 3 milik Pak Slamet) -> 403
PUT {{base}}/stalls/3
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Diambil Alih Bu Tini" }

### Admin boleh ubah stall siapa pun -> 200
PUT {{base}}/stalls/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Diubah oleh admin" }

### DELETE (admin saja). Owner -> 403
DELETE {{base}}/stalls/6
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### DELETE sebagai admin -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/stalls/6
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

############################################################ 5. REVIEW (login, semua role). user dari token
POST {{base}}/stalls/2/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Enak dan murah!" }

### Rating di luar 1..5 -> 400
POST {{base}}/stalls/2/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 9 }

### Tanpa token -> 401
POST {{base}}/stalls/2/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5 }

############################################################ 6. ENDPOINT LAIN (lanjutan Tugas 2)
### USERS (admin saja)
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
###
POST {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pak Owner Baru", "email": "ownerbaru@kantin.test", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "owner" }

### MENU_ITEMS: baca publik; tulis = owner (kantin miliknya) / admin
GET {{base}}/menu-items?stall_id=1
###
POST {{base}}/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stall_id": 1, "name": "Kwetiau Siram", "price": 16000, "is_available": true }

### Menu di kantin orang lain -> 403
POST {{base}}/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stall_id": 3, "name": "Menu Curang", "price": 1000 }

### REVIEWS: baca publik; hapus = penulis/admin
GET {{base}}/reviews?stall_id=1
###
DELETE {{base}}/reviews/16
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### LIKES (login). user_id dari token
POST {{base}}/likes
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "review_id": 3 }

### FLAGS & AUDIT_LOGS (admin saja)
GET {{base}}/flags?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
###
PUT {{base}}/flags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "resolved" }
###
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
###
POST {{base}}/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "RESOLVE_FLAG", "target_table": "FLAGS", "target_id": 1, "metadata": { "note": "review dihapus" } }

### Owner mengakses /flags -> 403
GET {{base}}/flags
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
